 Content Development Guidelines

 For Each Orb Essay:
. Start with unique essence - what makes this orb distinct
. Own your domain - don't borrow from other orbs
. Reference appropriately - acknowledge connections without claiming ownership
. Eliminate redundancy - check against other orbs before writing
. Focus on mechanism - how does this orb actually work
. Apply living frame - use the -section structure consistently

 Quality Checks:
- Does this content belong uniquely to this orb?
- Are we borrowing concepts from other orbs?
- Is the mechanism clear and distinct?
- Does it eliminate rather than create redundancy?
- Does it serve the system architecture?

